bespoke retries.\n\n## Approach\n\nAdd a behavioral tripwire whose effectful step increments an external observation and raises. Execute it through the production interpreter and assert one invocation, serial ordering, and immediate propagation. Retain current source/import checks as secondary architecture diagnostics.\n\n## Scope\n\n- `tests/unit/workflow/test_executor_tripwire.py`\n- existing workflow test fixtures needed to execute the real interpreter\n\n## Testing\n\nCover a raising effectful step, an ordinary successful sequence, and a later step that must remain uncalled after failure.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] A raising effectful step is observed exactly once through the production workflow runtime.\n- [ ] No downstream step runs after the injected failure and execution remains serial.\n- [ ] The successful multi-step control still executes each step once in declared order.\n- [ ] Existing import/prose tripwires remain as secondary diagnostics and the focused workflow suite passes.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[{"path":"tests/unit/workflow/test_executor_tripwire.py","reason":"add the behavioral once-only and serial-execution oracle"}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["parent","78f2-b104-e3c9-4b86"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"78f2-b104-e3c9-4b86","parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["janitor","workflow","oracle","rp06"],"ticket_id":"90e2-6d13-ecfb-4131","ticket_type":"story","title":"Add a behavioral single-invocation workflow oracle","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["d92f91b5-9d52-4524-b153-350c91ccdb55","bfe8e68c-ac0f-4e6c-9a24-acf7ea5cb1bb"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1788313691529696001,"uuid":"756c5140-4ff4-4fea-9118-ea43da2ae96a"}